# Citation metadata (Citation File Format). GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository".
# The DOI below is a placeholder until Zenodo mints one for the 1.0.0 release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Graph Digitizer"
abstract: >-
  A client-side graph digitizer: load a chart image, calibrate the axes from two known points
  each (linear, log, reciprocal, date/time) by hand or with tick-label OCR, trace plotted
  series or place points by hand on one or more lines, and export the table. Images never
  leave the browser.
authors:
